_position":"place-self-end-center text-center","desktop_column_span":1,"desktop_row_span":1,"desktop_text_position":"sm:place-self-end-center sm:text-center","background":"#000000","background_gradient":"","text_color":"#ffffff","text_gradient":"","button_background":"#000000","button_text_color":"#ffffff","overlay_color":"#000000","overlay_opacity":0}}},"block_order":["image_MgnbcT","image_DHkwLg","image_VwQ7Hg","image_jM4iEh"],"name":"Media grid","settings":{"anchor_id":"media-grid","full_width":true,"reduce_width":false,"desktop_row_height":290,"mobile_row_height":150,"background":"","background_gradient":""}},"multi_column_bUcXYW":{"type":"multi-column","blocks":{"item_77zXwN":{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Merach_T31B1_Foldable_Treadmill_with_18_Auto_Incline-2_7.jpg","column_size":"3","title":"Wide Running Surface","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>Enjoy an 18.11\" x 47.24\" spacious, non-slip running deck for a safer and more natural stride. Ideal for walking, jogging, or running with confidence and comfort.<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link","check-bg":"#000000","check-color":"#ffffff"}},"item_AUKXdT":{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Merach-T31b1-Treadmill-Details_1_4.png","column_size":"3","title":"7-Layer Soft Silent Running Belt","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>Our foldable treadmill features a 7-layer soft running belt that absorbs impact, protects joints, and ensures a quiet, stable stride—ideal for home or apartment workouts.<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link","check-bg":"#000000","check-color":"#ffffff"}},"item_FWiCMj":{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Merach_T31B1_Foldable_Treadmill_with_18_Auto_Incline-2_1.jpg","column_size":"3","title":"12 Silicone Shock Absorption","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>Built with 12 high-elastic silicone shock absorbers to reduce joint pressure and vibration, delivering a smooth, comfortable run on every step.<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link","check-bg":"#000000","check-color":"#ffffff"}},"item_NnRWkE":{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Merach_T31B1_Foldable_Treadmill_with_18_Auto_Incline-2_9.jpg","column_size":"3","title":"Free MERACH APP","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>Sync via Bluetooth to the MERACH App to track time, distance, speed, and calories. Access smart fitness data and adjust workouts instantly.<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link","check-bg":"#000000","check-color":"#ffffff"}},"item_HxLrkL":{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Merach_T31B1_Foldable_Treadmill_with_18_Auto_Incline-2_8.jpg","column_size":"3","title":"<45 dB Low Noise","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>This quiet treadmill for home use operates under 45 dB, letting you exercise anytime without disturbing family or neighbors—perfect for small spaces.<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link","check-bg":"#000000","check-color":"#ffffff"}},"item_cmGzgG":{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Merach_T31B1_Foldable_Treadmill_with_18_Auto_Incline-2_10.jpg","column_size":"3","title":"Compatible Apps","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>Merach, Kinomap, Zwift, Apple Health, Google Fit.<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link","check-bg":"#000000","check-color":"#ffffff"}}},"block_order":["item_77zXwN","item_AUKXdT","item_FWiCMj","item_NnRWkE","item_HxLrkL","item_cmGzgG"],"settings":{"full_width":true,"stack_on_mobile":false,"gap":"medium","text_alignment":"center","subheading":"","title":"","content":"","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":""}},"faq_weMq9E":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"item_wxtgXi":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"1. How steep is the incline on the Merach T31B1 treadmill?","content":"<p>The Merach T31B1 features 18 automatic incline levels up to 18%. This allows you to switch easily between flat running and challenging hill training, helping to improve endurance, strength and calorie burning.<\/p>"}},"item_ipmC7L":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"2. What speed does the Merach T31B1 treadmill reach?","content":"<p>The treadmill offers a speed range of 1–14 km\/h (0.6–8.7 mph), making it suitable for walking, brisk walking, jogging and running workouts at home.<br\/><\/p>"}},"item_HXX7xV":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"3. What is the maximum user weight for the Merach T31B1 treadmill?","content":"<p>The sturdy home treadmill supports a maximum user weight of up to 159 kg. Its robust frame provides stable and secure workouts, even during more intense training sessions.<\/p>"}},"item_DkTw8N":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"4. What training programmes does the Merach T31B1 treadmill offer?","content":"<p>The treadmill includes three professional training modes:<br\/><br\/>Steady Climb for consistent incline training<br\/>Power Hike for endurance-focused workouts<br\/>Hill Sprint for high-intensity interval training<br\/><br\/>In addition, the treadmill offers 20 built-in workout programmes.<\/p>"}},"item_gm8BdE":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"5. Is the Merach T31B1 treadmill joint-friendly?","content":"<p>Yes. The treadmill features a 7-layer running belt and 12 silicone shock absorbers, which help reduce impact and joint stress. This design provides a more comfortable and joint-friendly running experience.<\/p>"}},"item_fTHWjV":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"6. Is the Merach T31B1 treadmill foldable and space-saving?","content":"<p>Yes. The treadmill is equipped with a hydraulic folding system that allows it to be folded in about 30 seconds. This makes it ideal for homes, flats and compact home gyms where space is limited.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["item_wxtgXi","item_ipmC7L","item_HXX7xV","item_DkTw8N","item_gm8BdE","item_fTHWjV"],"settings":{"full_width":true,"subheading":"","title":"FAQ","content":"","team_avatar_width":160,"support_hours":"","answer_time":"","butt